                          {   'text': '\n'
                                      '            <p>Turnaround time is the second most common question customers '
                                      'ask. In Brisbane, computer repair timeframes fall into three distinct '
                                      'tiers:</p>\n'
                                      '            <ul>\n'
                                      '              <li><strong>Tier 1: Same-Day or 1 to 3 Hours (Local Warehouse '
                                      'Stock):</strong>\n'
                                      '                <p>Standard non-touch Full HD laptop screens (14-inch and '
                                      '15.6-inch 30-pin), high-speed NVMe Solid State Drives, DC power jacks, thermal '
                                      'paste overhauls, scam malware cleanups, and Windows reinstallations. Because '
                                      'these parts are stocked locally in Brisbane, repairs are completed the same day '
                                      'you call.</p>\n'
                                      '              </li>\n'
                                      '              <li><strong>Tier 2: 24 to 48 Hours (Express Interstate '
                                      'Distributor Dispatch):</strong>\n'
                                      '                <p>Specialized 2-in-1 school touchscreens (Acer Spin, HP x360, '
                                      'Lenovo Flex 5), 144Hz–240Hz fast gaming display panels, high-capacity internal '
                                      'laptop batteries, and original MacBook display lid assemblies. These parts are '
                                      'flown overnight from Sydney or Melbourne master warehouses.</p>\n'
                                      '              </li>\n'
                                      '              <li><strong>Tier 3: 3 to 5 Business Days (Specialized Overseas '
                                      'OEM Sourcing):</strong>\n'
                                      '                <p>Vintage laptop hinge casings, proprietary dual-fan cooling '
                                      'heatsinks, or discontinued motherboard sub-assemblies. In these cases, our '
                                      'technicians provide tracking updates and can arrange a loan laptop so you stay '
                                      'productive.</p>\n'
                                      '              </li>\n'
                                      '            </ul>\n'
                                      '            ',
                              'title': 'What Determines Repair Timeframes in Brisbane?',
                              'type': 'h2'},
